# The browser-test harness is dev-only: the image neither builds it nor ships
# it. Excluded so that editing a spec does not invalidate the `COPY . .` layer
# and rebuild everything after it.
#
# It also used to be load-bearing. While the build stage ran
# `npm run typecheck --workspaces`, this workspace — whose `@playwright/test`
# the stage has no reason to install — failed the production image build. That
# stage now only builds, so the coupling is gone and this is an optimisation
# again rather than a fix.
packages/e2e
